      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Armory",
      "translation" : "軍械庫"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Library",
      "translation" : "圖書館"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Job Agency",
      "translation" : "轉職所"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Prontera Castle",
      "translation" : "普隆德拉城堡"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "City Hall",
      "translation" : "市政廳"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm... I dunno why she would be there... guess I'll take a look.",
      "translation" : "嗯...我不知道她為什麼會在那裡...我去看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wow I never knew she was a religious person... I'll see to it thanks.",
      "translation" : "哇，我不知道她信教...我會去找她的，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm.... are you sure about that?",
      "translation" : "嗯...你確定嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why would she need to go there? I think you might be mistaken.",
      "translation" : "她為什麼要去那裡？我覺得你可能弄錯了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The only thing she'd need at a Kit shop is medicine for her rheumatism. She's probably long gone from there by now.",
      "translation" : "她去套裝商店唯一可能是買治風溼的藥。她現在大概早就不在那裡了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't think she needs to be there, she LIVES here in Prontera.",
      "translation" : "我覺得她不可能在那裡，她就住在普隆德拉。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah I see, if she's studying then I don't want to bother her. Thanks anyways.",
      "translation" : "啊，我明白了。如果她在學習，我就不去打擾她了。還是謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Job Agency?  I don't think so.  Don't lead me all around Prontera please! She's already a teacher here.",
      "translation" : "轉職所？我覺得不是吧。別帶著我在普隆德拉到處跑了！她已經是這裡的老師了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The castle eh, I don't want to step in there... just doesn't feel like my style. I don't like that noble feeling of importance type of thing.",
      "translation" : "城堡啊...我不想進去...感覺不適合我。我不喜歡那種貴族高高在上的氣派。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "O wow, did she become an important part of Prontera? I'd think she's too busy for me to visit. I'll try again later.",
      "translation" : "哇，她成了普隆德拉的重要人物嗎？她應該很忙，我還是改天再去拜訪吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mason]",
      "translation" : "[梅森]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, I heard that her class was somewhere around there... thanks a lot! Here's a lil something for your help.",
      "translation" : "啊，我聽說她的教室就在那附近...太感謝你了！這是給你的謝禮。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yay, I found her! Thank you very much for you help!",
      "translation" : "耶，我找到她了！非常感謝你的幫助！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hi! I came here to Prontera in search of an old lady... But...",
      "translation" : "嗨！我來普隆德拉找一位老太太...不過..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Mason",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh.. Ok.. Thanks anyways.",
      "translation" : "哦...好吧...還是謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Mojo",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mojo]",
      "translation" : "[莫喬]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Mojo",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh no!  I lost my teacher's ^FF0000old magic book^000000!",
      "translation" : "糟了！我把老師的^FF0000古老魔法書^000000弄丟了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Mojo",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What am I going to do... those dumb Bathory...",
      "translation" : "我該怎麼辦...那些笨蛋巴托莉..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Mojo",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I lost my teacher's book!  What am I going to do...",
      "translation" : "我把老師的書弄丟了！我該怎麼辦..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Marie]",
      "translation" : "[瑪麗]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hello, is there something you need?",
      "translation" : "你好，有什麼需要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No nothing at all.",
      "translation" : "沒什麼事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your teacher sent me.",
      "translation" : "你的老師派我來的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Marie]",
      "translation" : "[瑪麗]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What does he want from me?",
      "translation" : "他找我有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Marie]",
      "translation" : "[瑪麗]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh wait, I see... he wants his reference scroll back am I right? Well, I'm kinda still using it buuut... I'll give it back if you can gimme a poring egg and an incubator. Those things are so cute!",
      "translation" : "哦，等等，我明白了...他想要回參考卷軸，對吧？我還在用呢，不過...如果你能給我一個波利蛋和一個寵物孵化器，我就還給他。這些東西太可愛了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hi! What do you want from me?",
      "translation" : "嗨！你找我有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Marie]",
      "translation" : "[瑪麗]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hrrmm okay? Cya then..",
      "translation" : "嗯，好吧？那回頭見..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Heyyy there, you have a poring egg and the pet incubator to go with it! Are those for me?",
      "translation" : "嘿，你帶了波利蛋和寵物孵化器！這些是給我的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yep!",
      "translation" : "是的！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sorry, no.",
      "translation" : "不是，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Marie]",
      "translation" : "[瑪麗]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yatta!  Here's a lil something in return.",
      "translation" : "太好啦！這是給你的一點回禮。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh.. pooo... sigh...",
      "translation" : "哦...波利...唉..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Marie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yay! I love Porings!",
      "translation" : "耶！我最喜歡波利了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabius]",
      "translation" : "[法比烏斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You speak Umbalian fluently! So you will never forget the language of Umbalians!",
      "translation" : "你已經能流利地說汶巴拉語了！所以永遠不會忘記汶巴拉人的語言！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, you've done well in retrieving my references. These artifacts holds information about ruins around the world, from the burning hell of the Magma Dungeon, to the strange eerie Hidden Forest of Yggdrasil.",
      "translation" : "啊，你順利找回了我的參考資料。這些文物記載著世界各地遺蹟的資訊，從岩漿洞窟的灼熱地獄，到伊格德拉修樹的詭異幽暗森林。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabius]",
      "translation" : "[法比烏斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But enough talk, you're just eager to get your reward aren't you?  Well it may not sound much, but my reward for you is knowledge...",
      "translation" : "不過話說回來，你只是急著領報酬，對吧？聽起來可能不算什麼，但我要給你的獎勵是知識..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabius]",
      "translation" : "[法比烏斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Actually it is knowledge of the Umbalian people. They are connected to this world of Midgard in some special way, we just can't confirm it yet. There is a theory that they may be like the elves and protect the ancient tree of Yggdrasil.",
      "translation" : "更準確地說，是汶巴拉人的知識。他們與米德加爾特世界有某種特殊聯絡，只是我們還不能確定。有一種說法認為，他們像精靈一樣守護著古老的伊格德拉修樹。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabius]",
      "translation" : "[法比烏斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And I, a great wise man of Juno, will teach you their language!",
      "translation" : "而我，朱諾偉大的智者，將教你他們的語言！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000FF Learned the language of Umbalians! ^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000FF學會了汶巴拉人的語言！^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Argh! My three students ran off with my references! Hey you! Can you get them back for me? I'll gladly reward you.",
      "translation" : "哎呀！我的三個學生帶著參考資料跑掉了！喂，你能幫我找回來嗎？我一定會好好酬謝你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabius]",
      "translation" : "[法比烏斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "From what I know, they're in different separate towns making something out of themselves.",
      "translation" : "據我所知，他們分散在不同的城鎮，各自忙著自己的事情。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh... You found Marie in Amatsu.",
      "translation" : "哦...你在天津町找到了瑪麗。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You saw Mojo in Aldebaran?",
      "translation" : "你在艾爾帕蘭見到了莫喬？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So... Mason's in Prontera now... Well...",
      "translation" : "那麼...梅森現在在普隆德拉...嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I wonder where is our sea girl Marie?",
      "translation" : "不知道海邊的女孩瑪麗在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mojo should be somewhere near water...",
      "translation" : "莫喬應該在水邊附近..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Wise Man Fabius",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Where'd Mason go then...",
      "translation" : "那麼梅森去哪兒了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
